  "display_title": "Goodnight Cinderella",
  "description": "Hong Jin-Ju and Ji Su-Jeong couldn't be any more different. Jin-Ju is bubbly, popular, and more interested in hanging out with friends and chasing women than worrying about school. On the other hand, Su-Jeong is quiet and reserved, relying on her good grades to earn her scholarship money to afford her tuition. Contrary to her closed off and frigid appearance, Su-Jeong is secretly the model and muse for the lingerie company, “Goodnight Cinderella.” Jin-Ju is drawn to the mysterious nature of Su-Jeong and wants to get to know her better, meanwhile Su-Jeong is keen to stay away and protect her secrets. Watch as the juicy drama unfolds on campus.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
